1. Cloud Services I Use: List at least 3 cloud services or applications you use regularly (e.g. Google Drive, Netflix, Messenger, Canva, GCash).
-Cloud computing is part of my everyday life because many of the applications I use rely on cloud technology. Three cloud-based applications I regularly use are Messenger, Facebook, and Google Chrome. I use Messenger to 
